{"id": "lang-065", "source": "independent", "categories": ["cultural", "simple-enquiry", "needs-silence", "closing"], "lang": "en", "country": "KE", "critical": false, "notes": "A Muslim colleague in Garissa buying an ordination gift; 'Salaam', 'Shukran', 'Allah akubariki'. Good: no assumption she is Christian, no preaching, simple explanation of stole colours, gift wrapping answered, closers honoured.", "turns": [{"user": "Salaam. I am in Garissa; my colleague is a pastor and is being ordained next month. I want to gift him a stole. I don't know much about these things, what colour is right?", "expect": {"lang": "en", "next": "answer", "length_kind": "default", "forbid": ["as a christian you", "you should know"], "judge": ["culture"]}}, {"user": "Thank you. Price for the white one with the gold cross? And can you wrap it as a gift?", "expect": {"lang": "en", "next": "quote", "length_kind": "short", "figures": "hub-only"}}, {"user": "Shukran, I will confirm after payday.", "expect": {"lang": "en", "next": "hold_ack", "said": "needs_time", "length_kind": "short", "forbid": ["\\?", "shall i (start|reserve|place|go ahead)|would you like (me )?to|ready to (order|proceed)|special offer|discount|today only"]}}, {"user": "Asante, Allah akubariki.", "expect": {"lang": "sw", "next": "silence", "said": "closing", "length_kind": "ack", "forbid": ["\\?"], "judge": ["culture"]}}]}
